VALUES (4975, 'tt0119577', NULL, 'Love Is the Devil: Study for a Portrait of Francis Bacon', 'Love Is the Devil: Study for a Portrait of Francis Bacon', 'movie', 1998, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zPTMTbYPhXXzAo5UQkeSpcmSMl.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2OIb7XZKkgeqS1qX64EkxKXMjC8.jpg', 'In the 1960s, British painter Francis Bacon surprises a burglar and invites him to share his bed. The burglar, a working class man named George Dyer, accepts. After the unique beginning to their love affair, the well-connected and volatile artist assimilates Dyer into his circle of eccentric friends, as Dyer''s struggle with addiction strains their bond.', NULL, NULL, 1.8148, 6.1, 0, 9.55, '2026-11-25 02:42:45', '2026-11-25 02:42:45')
