VALUES (10830, 'tt0117008', NULL, 'Matilda', 'Matilda', 'movie', 1996, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYoDpWInsBEVSmWStnRH06ddoyk.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t3HVA7XdVnQneMjI5hYjEhXmHY3.jpg', 'Matilda Wormwood is an brilliant and intelligent little girl. Unfortunately, her parents, Harry and Zinnia, fail to see that fact. As time passes, she finally starts school and has a kind teacher, loyal friends, and a terrifying, sadistic headmistress. As she becomes fed up with the constant cruelty, she discovers she has a special gift that she just might be able to use to outwit the unruly adults around her.', NULL, NULL, 12.6097, 7.195, 0, 2.7565652173913044e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-25 02:42:45')
